      },
      "message": "fix(xtask): reserve the pin's temp dir atomically; add three crash statuses\n\nReview of PR #3302: the pin used create_dir_all on a PID-named temp\ndirectory, the #3290 fault in a /tmp that several runner accounts share.\nIt now reserves a fresh directory with create_dir and steps past\nAlreadyExists. The decision file states that the wopr abort is put on\nthe driver only by its time.\n\nRefs #3258\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
